# 引用の情報（GitHub のリポのページの「Cite this repository」はここから作られる）。
# 版を上げたら version・date-released も直す（tests/test_public_docs.py が pyproject.toml の版と比べる）
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this kit in a paper or presentation, please cite it as below.
  State the release tag you used and the firmware version of both boards
  (fw= in the output of `uv run csikit doctor`).
type: software
title: "M5Stack CSI Kit"
abstract: >-
  A kit for recording Wi-Fi channel state information (CSI) with two M5Stack Basic
  boards and a PC: firmware for a transmitter and a receiver, and Python tools to
  check, flash, monitor, record and load the data.
authors:
  - family-names: Yoshida
    given-names: Nobufumi
    affiliation: "Professional Graduate School of Information Science, Shunan University"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-28"
repository-code: "https://github.com/shunan-u-lab/m5stack-csi-kit"
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - Wi-Fi sensing
  - channel state information
  - CSI
  - ESP32
  - M5Stack
